---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Elysium Designer — End User License Agreement">
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pt-40 pb-24">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-[700]">Elysium Designer — EULA</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[0.85rem] text-muted">Draft — pending legal review. Last updated July 2026.</p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink/90">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-[650]">1. License</h2>
      <p>
        Elysium Designer is licensed to you by <strong>Lamaute Labs LLC</strong>,
        not sold. Subject to an active subscription ($8/month, or $79/year
        prepaid annually) or an active trial, you receive a personal,
        non-exclusive, non-transferable license to install and use the Designer
        on your devices, enforced by a license key. Licenses remain valid while
        the subscription is active.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-[650]">2. Trial</h2>
      <p>
        The free trial provides the full feature set for a limited period. When
        it ends, continued use requires a purchased license.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-[650]">3. Your work is yours</h2>
      <p>
        Everything you create with the Designer — skins, themes, .esk files,
        exported assets — belongs to you, including for commercial use.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-[650]">4. Restrictions</h2>
      <p>
        You may not reverse-engineer, decompile, or bypass the license
        protection; redistribute the application; or use the Elysium name or
        Blue Morpho logo for derived products without permission.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-[650]">5. No warranty; limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        The Designer is provided "as is." To the maximum extent permitted by
        law, liability is limited to the amount you paid for the license.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-[650]">Contact</h2>
      <p><a class="text-iris hover:underline" href="mailto:support@elysiumui.com">support@elysiumui.com</a></p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
